# Both images build from the repository root. An allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless named here, so no
# secret, private data (.secrets/ holds the household's real files) or local state can reach an image (1F1 final review).
*
!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!Nid.slnx
!src/
!web/
# The demo household's invented files, embedded in the host for demo mode (issue 203).
!deploy/local/demo/*.nid.json

# Inside what is allowed: build outputs and local files.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/*.local
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/TestResults/
web/dist/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
